const body = "<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-6v6epgig alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-qsk5wqzs\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-drksozlu uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h1 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Your Data, Our Care: BlueStaffyUK’s Commitment to Privacy</h1></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>At BlueStaffyUK, we treat your personal information with the same dedication we give our beloved Blue Staffies. Discover how we protect your data, ensuring <strong>UK GDPR compliance</strong> and complete transparency.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-buttons uagb-buttons__outer-wrap uagb-btn__default-btn uagb-btn-tablet__default-btn uagb-btn-mobile__default-btn uagb-block-ttmaolcg\"><div class=\"uagb-buttons__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-buttons-child uagb-buttons__outer-wrap uagb-block-d3c70282 wp-block-button\"><div class=\"uagb-button__wrapper\"><a aria-label=\"\" class=\"uagb-buttons-repeater wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/buy-blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"follow noopener\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"uagb-button__link\">View All Staffies</div><span class=\"uagb-button__icon uagb-button__icon-position-after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focussable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 278.6l-160 160C272.4 444.9 264.2 448 256 448s-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25L338.8 288H32C14.33 288 .0016 273.7 .0016 256S14.33 224 32 224h306.8l-105.4-105.4c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0l160 160C451.1 245.9 451.1 266.1 438.6 278.6z\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-zkbxkoua wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Privacy Policy | Minimalist silhouette of a calm Staffordshire Bull Terrier representing trust and privacy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/privacy-policy-staffy-silhouette-bluestaffyuk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/privacy-policy-staffy-silhouette-bluestaffyuk.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></figure></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e71umpm2 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-cral98df uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Your Privacy Policy Matters to BlueStaffyUK</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>At BlueStaffyUK, we understand that entrusting us with your personal information is a big deal, especially when you’re seeking a new family member. Your privacy and the security of your data are paramount to us, just as the health and well-being of our Staffies are. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information, ensuring we comply with UK data protection laws, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018. <strong>Data Controller:</strong> Explicitly state: “BlueStaffyUK is the data controller responsible for your data.<br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xegfvq4m\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-x7k2aq3p uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">What Information Do We Collect?</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We collect various types of information to provide you with the best possible service and to help you find your perfect Blue Staffy companion:</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cilcihz3\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-isruz778 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Directly Provided Information</strong></h4></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Details like name, email, phone, physical address, and any specific information about your home/family are provided when inquiring about our blue staffies. We collect this information to understand your needs better and help you find the right staffy puppies with a <a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\">health guarantee</a>. <br/></p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-c4knxnbp uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Automated Data</strong></h4></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Includes IP address, browser type, pages visited, time spent, etc., typically through cookies (with a note to see the Cookies section). This data helps us improve our website and resources, such as our comprehensive <strong><a href=\"/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">first-time blue staffy owner guide</a></strong>.</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-wnroxhqv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We collect this information through direct interactions (like filling out a contact form) and automated technologies (like website analytics). </p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-iyd8o53d alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-nzgnqcu6 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Blue Staffy owner discussing privacy policy with a staff member, with text “How We Use Your Information” clearly visible.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"675\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-privacy-policy-info-discussion.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-privacy-policy-info-discussion.webp 450w\" width=\"450\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xobgtrgd\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-t2kyngdh uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">How We Use Your Information</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Lists purposes with lawful bases (e.g., responding to inquiries about our L-2HGA clear <strong>Staffy puppies</strong>; providing info on <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier breeding dogs</strong>; website improvement; legal compliance). We use this information responsibly to ensure you’re well-informed, from initial inquiry to understanding the <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">health and care of Blue Staffies</a></strong>.<br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-pj51aj2q uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM256 352C309 352 352 309 352 256C352 202.1 309 160 256 160C202.1 160 160 202.1 160 256C160 309 202.1 352 256 352z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>To respond to your inquiries about our pedigree blue Staffy puppies UK and provide you with relevant information (Lawful Basis: Performance of a Contract / Legitimate Interest).</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-b41d4894 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM256 352C309 352 352 309 352 256C352 202.1 309 160 256 160C202.1 160 160 202.1 160 256C160 309 202.1 352 256 352z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>To provide information about our Staffordshire Bull Terrier breeding dogs and services (Lawful Basis: Performance of a Contract / Legitimate Interest). </p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-9b932396 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM256 352C309 352 352 309 352 256C352 202.1 309 160 256 160C202.1 160 160 202.1 160 256C160 309 202.1 352 256 352z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>To improve your website experience and our services (Lawful Basis: Legitimate Interest).</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-e46232c2 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM256 352C309 352 352 309 352 256C352 202.1 309 160 256 160C202.1 160 160 202.1 160 256C160 309 202.1 352 256 352z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>For internal record-keeping and administrative purposes (Lawful Basis: Legitimate Interest).</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-cdbdb301 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM256 352C309 352 352 309 352 256C352 202.1 309 160 256 160C202.1 160 160 202.1 160 256C160 309 202.1 352 256 352z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>To comply with legal obligations (Lawful Basis: Legal Obligation).</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-aacw3bii alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nf3pbglc uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Third-Party Services</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We work with reputable providers such as <a href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">The Kennel Club</a> and DEFRA-approved pet transport services. We also use <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Analytics</a> for analytics.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-d0dyxyya\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-p10fzrxs uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Your Rights</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>You can request to view, edit, or delete your data at any time by contacting us via the <a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Us</a> page.</p>\n<p>For more about your data rights in the UK, visit <a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ICO.org.uk</a>.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-qgixhffg uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Commitment to Data Security</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We take the security of your data seriously. We employ robust technical and organisational measures to protect your data from unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. This includes using secure servers, data encryption (SSL), restricting access to personal data, and regular staff training. We treat your information with the same care and dedication we apply to our beloved Blue Staffy family.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-uwlexcfa alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-myj5gno2 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Sharing Your Information</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>BlueStaffyUK does not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes. We may share your data only in the following limited circumstances:</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-9oadnpuw\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-afmr9wa2\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-cnoagvol uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">01</p></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>With trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or serving you, provided those parties agree to keep this information confidential (e.g., website hosting, email communication platforms).</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-de7ioerq\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-uonmbuz8 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">02</p></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>If arranging DEFRA pet transport for your puppy, necessary personal details will be shared with the approved, third-party transport service to facilitate the safe and compliant delivery of your new family member.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cqiivmpw\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-mcatcqek uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">03</p></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>When legally required to do so, for example, in response to a court order or other legal process.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xqyt1i7b alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-jtnyek54 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Your Rights Regarding Your Data (GDPR &amp; Data Protection Act 2018)</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>As a UK resident, you have significant rights regarding your data:</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-osv5pvik alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-dplqxx5b\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-muwfsvit uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 448c0 17.67-14.33 32-32 32H32c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32h64V123.8L49.75 154.6C35.02 164.5 15.19 160.4 5.375 145.8C-4.422 131.1-.4531 111.2 14.25 101.4l96-64c9.828-6.547 22.45-7.187 32.84-1.594C153.5 41.37 160 52.22 160 64.01v352h64C241.7 416 256 430.3 256 448z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Access</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-rgin9uen uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 448c0 17.67-14.33 32-32 32H32c-13.08 0-24.83-7.953-29.7-20.09c-4.859-12.12-1.859-26 7.594-35.03l193.6-185.1c31.36-30.17 33.95-80 5.812-113.4c-14.91-17.69-35.86-28.12-58.97-29.38C127.4 95.83 105.3 103.9 88.53 119.9L53.52 151.7c-13.08 11.91-33.33 10.89-45.2-2.172C-3.563 136.5-2.594 116.2 10.48 104.3l34.45-31.3c28.67-27.34 68.39-42.11 108.9-39.88c40.33 2.188 78.39 21.16 104.4 52.03c49.8 59.05 45.2 147.3-10.45 200.8l-136 130H288C305.7 416 320 430.3 320 448z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Erasure (Right to be Forgotten)</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p> In certain circumstances, you can request that we delete your data.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-wjy0znoh uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 344c0 74.98-61.02 136-136 136H103.6c-46.34 0-87.31-29.53-101.1-73.48c-5.594-16.77 3.484-34.88 20.25-40.47c16.75-5.609 34.89 3.484 40.47 20.25c5.922 17.77 22.48 29.7 41.23 29.7H184c39.7 0 72-32.3 72-72s-32.3-72-72-72H80c-13.2 0-25.05-8.094-29.83-20.41C45.39 239.3 48.66 225.3 58.38 216.4l131.4-120.4H32c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32h240c13.2 0 25.05 8.094 29.83 20.41c4.781 12.3 1.516 26.27-8.203 35.19l-131.4 120.4H184C258.1 208 320 269 320 344z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Data Portability</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">You can request to receive your data in a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image aligncenter uagb-block-gzjt0jtj wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A breeder holding a blue Staffy puppy, smiling, in a home environment, Responsible breeders of blue Staffies L-2-HGA clear.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/breeder-sitting-blue-staffy-puppy-home.webp\" srcset=\"/images/breeder-sitting-blue-staffy-puppy-home.webp 640w\" width=\"640\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-fsjhf4we\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-99mlavlt uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M384 334.2c0 17.67-14.33 32-32 32h-32v81.78c0 17.67-14.33 32-32 32s-32-14.33-32-32v-81.78H32c-10.97 0-21.17-5.625-27.05-14.89c-5.859-9.266-6.562-20.89-1.875-30.81l128-270.2C138.6 34.33 157.8 27.56 173.7 35.09c15.97 7.562 22.78 26.66 15.22 42.63L82.56 302.2H256V160c0-17.67 14.33-32 32-32s32 14.33 32 32v142.2h32C369.7 302.2 384 316.6 384 334.2z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Rectification</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">You can ask us to correct any inaccurate or incomplete data.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-bnyb4lnn uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 344.6c0 74.66-60.73 135.4-135.4 135.4H104.7c-46.81 0-88.22-29.83-103-74.23c-5.594-16.77 3.469-34.89 20.23-40.48c16.83-5.625 34.91 3.469 40.48 20.23c6.078 18.23 23.08 30.48 42.3 30.48h79.95c39.36 0 71.39-32.03 71.39-71.39s-32.03-71.38-71.39-71.38H32c-9.484 0-18.47-4.203-24.56-11.48C1.359 254.5-1.172 244.9 .5156 235.6l32-177.2C35.27 43.09 48.52 32.01 64 32.01l192 .0049c17.67 0 32 14.33 32 32s-14.33 32-32 32H90.73L70.3 209.2h114.3C259.3 209.2 320 269.1 320 344.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Restrict Processing</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">You can ask us to limit how we use your data.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-vy2xhp11 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M167.7 160.8l64.65-76.06c11.47-13.45 9.812-33.66-3.656-45.09C222.7 34.51 215.3 32.01 208 32.01c-9.062 0-18.06 3.833-24.38 11.29C38.07 214.5 0 245.5 0 320c0 88.22 71.78 160 160 160s160-71.78 160-160C320 234.4 252.3 164.9 167.7 160.8zM160 416c-52.94 0-96-43.06-96-96s43.06-95.1 96-95.1s96 43.06 96 95.1S212.9 416 160 416z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Object</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">You can object to our processing of your data based on legitimate interests.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-0d7b1c55 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M315.6 80.14l-224 384c-5.953 10.19-16.66 15.88-27.67 15.88c-5.469 0-11.02-1.406-16.09-4.359c-15.27-8.906-20.42-28.5-11.52-43.77l195.9-335.9H32c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32h256c11.45 0 22.05 6.125 27.75 16.06S321.4 70.23 315.6 80.14z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"> If we are processing your data based on your consent, you have the right to withdraw that consent at any time.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<p>To discuss your data rights or any concerns, please <strong><a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">contact our staffy puppy breeders UK</a></strong>. We are here to assist you with any privacy-related queries. We will respond to all legitimate requests within one month. We will respond to all legitimate requests within one month. You also have the right to complain to the UK’s supervisory authority for data protection, the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO). <br/><br/>You can find more information on their website: <a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.ico.org.uk</a>. For general guidance on your data rights, you can also visit <a href=\"https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/about-us/information/citizens-advice-privacy-policy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Citizens Advice</a> or <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/data-protection\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GOV.UK Data Protection</a>.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-hui8m3vz alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5lazzd9n uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">BlueStaffyUK’s Cookies</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-3jtl7d6o\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-sja2zpi5 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Cookies Policy</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>A summary of cookie usage (e.g., “Our website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. This includes essential cookies for site functionality and analytics cookies to understand how our site is used. For more insights into responsible ownership, you can also check our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-blog-guides/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">c</a></strong>.”)<br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-txsunfdd uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated “Last Updated” date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-otk1sjij alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-qt1o45oi uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Contact Us About Your Privacy</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please do not hesitate to contact <a href=\"/thank-you-blue-staffy-puppies-journey/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">our friendly team</a>:</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">CONTACT US</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-9cwfhh4c uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:privacy@bluestaffyuk.uk\">staffies@bluestaffyuk.uk</a> </p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"> Last Updated: June 20, 2025</h3></div></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n";
